  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a July 2024 X post, Shive thanked Fed AI hack-a-thon participants in Washington, D.C., Atlanta, and New York City for helping solve tough problems. In reported remarks, Shive emphasized seeing positive value generation through traditional business measures when applying AI. He described USAi as “infrastructure for America’s AI future” and said it allows head-to-head model comparisons to capture model telemetry. He also said models have different strengths and weaknesses and that GSA has used AI in cyber defenses for over a decade.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
